40
00:02:06.817 --> 00:02:27.034
Malis learns to tell the time. The short clock hand shows the hour and the long hand shows the minutes. School starts at eight o'clock. Lunch is at noon. At a quarter past four, Malis runs a race and her coach uses a stopwatch. She goes to bed at half past eight, long before midnight.

